 verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**take off**","tirar (roupa)","Take off your coat. — Tire o casaco."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the office","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the office","lines":[["Ana","Do you have any coffee?","Você tem café?"],["Leo","Yes, I have some.","Tenho um pouco."],["Ana","Do you have breakfast at work?","Você toma café no trabalho?"],["Leo","Yes, at my desk.","Sim, na mesa."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: /h/ de house","items":[{"label":"/h/ de house","note":"O /h/ é um sopro de ar: house, hat, hear.","words":["house","hat","hear","help","home","hello"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you have for breakfast.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I have some bread and coffee."},{"q":"Ask: Do you have any…?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Do you have any tea?"},{"q":"Say what you don’t have.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I don’t have any milk."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with some and any.","model":"I have some bread. I don’t have any milk. Do you have any tea? I have lunch at noon. Take off your coat.","checklist":["Usei **some**","Usei **any**","Usei **have lunch**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “breakfast” mean?","opts":["almoço","café da manhã","casaco"],"ans":1,"why":"**breakfast** = café da manhã."},{"q":"What does “lunch” mean?","opts":["jantar","mesa de trabalho","almoço"],"ans":2,"why":"**lunch** = almoço."},{"q":"What does “dinner” mean?","opts":["jantar","casaco","pão"],"ans":0,"why":"**dinner** = jantar."},{"q":"What does “coat” mean?","opts":["mesa de trabalho","casaco","chá"],"ans":1,"why":"**coat** = casaco."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato